      "writtenOn": "2026-03-21T00:07:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I conclude this table from spec and test:\n\u003e | BeginAccess Input Fences | Texture Used by Dawn? | EndAccess Output Fences                       |\n\u003e |--------------------------|-----------------------|-----------------------------------------------|\n\u003e | 0                        | Yes                   | 1 (The Queue\u0027s SharedFence @ lastUsageSerial) |\n\u003e | 0                        | No                    | 0                                             |\n\u003e | N                        | Yes                   | 1 (The Queue\u0027s SharedFence @ lastUsageSerial) |\n\u003e | N                        | No                    | N (The input fences)                          |\n\nWhen texture is used by gpu, `SharedTexture::OnBeforeSubmit` calls `AcquirePendingFences` to wait and clear on all fences and return a new fence from queue in `EndAccessInternal`\nI believe this is also true for vulkan (vulkan::SharedTextureMemory::EndAccessImpl ) also only return one `Ref\u003cSharedFence\u003e fence`. Does vk semaphore has any special cases?",
